.nh
.TH "PB-ACCOUNT" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-account - Manage your Paperboat account


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb account [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Commands for your Paperboat account itself, as opposed to its machines, teams or sessions. Deleting the account removes everything it owns and is done only in the Paperboat console, where you confirm it with your email; \fBpb account delete\fR prints the link.

.PP
With --json, this command group lists its available commands.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for account


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print machine-readable JSON

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb(1)\fP, \fBpb-account-delete(1)\fP
